# Login & Home - Clean Architecture + BLoC

Xây dựng 2 màn hình mẫu (Login & Home) trên nền `flutter_base_project` đã có sẵn. Dự án đang dùng: **GetIt/Injectable** (DI), **Dio** (Network), **auto_route** (Router), **flutter_gen** (Assets/Colors).

Cần bổ sung: `flutter_bloc`, `equatable`, `dartz` để hoàn chỉnh Clean Architecture + BLoC.

## Kiến trúc tổng thể

```
lib/
├── core/               # ✅ Đã có (DI, network, router, local, theme)
├── mvp/                # ✅ Đã có (giữ nguyên)
├── features/
│   ├── auth/
│   │   ├── domain/     # Entities, Repository abstraction, UseCases
│   │   ├── data/       # Models, DataSources, Repository impl
│   │   └── presentation/ # BLoC, Pages, Widgets
│   └── home/
│       ├── domain/
│       ├── data/
│       └── presentation/
└── view/               # ✅ Đã có (widgets, res/theme)
```

## Proposed Changes

---

### Dependencies

#### [MODIFY] [pubspec.yaml](file:///Users/vutruong/development/flutter_base/flutter_base_project/pubspec.yaml)
Thêm vào [dependencies](file:///Users/vutruong/development/flutter_base/flutter_base_project/.flutter-plugins-dependencies):
- `flutter_bloc: ^8.1.6`
- `equatable: ^2.0.5`
- `dartz: ^0.10.1`

---

### Core - Base Classes

#### [NEW] `lib/core/usecases/usecase.dart`
Abstract class `UseCase<Type, Params>` — interface chung cho tất cả use cases (Single Responsibility, Open/Closed).

#### [NEW] `lib/core/usecases/no_params.dart`
Class `NoParams` extends `Equatable` — dùng khi UseCase không cần params.

#### [NEW] `lib/core/error/failures.dart`
[Failure](file:///Users/vutruong/development/flutter_base/flutter_base_project/lib/core/network/error_handle.dart#63-109) abstract class và các subclass: `ServerFailure`, `NetworkFailure`, `CacheFailure`.

---

### Feature: Auth

#### [NEW] `lib/features/auth/domain/entities/user_entity.dart`
Data class thuần túy (không phụ thuộc framework), dùng `Equatable`.

#### [NEW] `lib/features/auth/domain/repositories/auth_repository.dart`
Abstract interface (Dependency Inversion Principle):
```dart
abstract class AuthRepository {
  Future<Either<Failure, UserEntity>> login(String email, String password);
  Future<Either<Failure, bool>> logout();
  Future<Either<Failure, bool>> isLoggedIn();
}
```

#### [NEW] `lib/features/auth/domain/usecases/login_usecase.dart`
`LoginUseCase` extends `UseCase<UserEntity, LoginParams>`.

#### [NEW] `lib/features/auth/domain/usecases/logout_usecase.dart`
`LogoutUseCase` extends `UseCase<bool, NoParams>`.

#### [NEW] `lib/features/auth/data/models/user_model.dart`
`UserModel` extends `UserEntity`, hỗ trợ `fromJson`/`toJson`.

#### [NEW] `lib/features/auth/data/datasources/auth_remote_datasource.dart`
Abstract + Impl: gọi API login qua [ApiService](file:///Users/vutruong/development/flutter_base/flutter_base_project/lib/core/network/api_service.dart#10-103).

#### [NEW] `lib/features/auth/data/datasources/auth_local_datasource.dart`
Abstract + Impl: lưu/đọc token từ [LocalStorage](file:///Users/vutruong/development/flutter_base/flutter_base_project/lib/core/local/local_storage.dart#23-43).

#### [NEW] `lib/features/auth/data/repositories/auth_repository_impl.dart`
`AuthRepositoryImpl` implements `AuthRepository` (Dependency Inversion).

#### [NEW] `lib/features/auth/presentation/bloc/login_bloc.dart`
`LoginBloc` xử lý: `LoginSubmitted` event → `LoginLoading`, `LoginSuccess`, `LoginFailure` states.

#### [NEW] `lib/features/auth/presentation/pages/login_page.dart`
UI với form email/password, nút Login. BlocListener navigate tới Home khi success.

#### [NEW] `lib/features/auth/presentation/widgets/login_form.dart`
Widget form tách riêng (Single Responsibility).

---

### Feature: Home

#### [NEW] `lib/features/home/domain/entities/user_profile_entity.dart`
Entity cho profile user trên trang Home.

#### [NEW] `lib/features/home/domain/repositories/home_repository.dart`
```dart
abstract class HomeRepository {
  Future<Either<Failure, UserProfileEntity>> getUserProfile();
}
```

#### [NEW] `lib/features/home/domain/usecases/get_user_profile_usecase.dart`
`GetUserProfileUseCase` extends `UseCase<UserProfileEntity, NoParams>`.

#### [NEW] `lib/features/home/data/models/user_profile_model.dart`
`UserProfileModel` extends `UserProfileEntity`.

#### [NEW] `lib/features/home/data/datasources/home_remote_datasource.dart`
Abstract + Impl, giả lập dữ liệu mock (demo).

#### [NEW] `lib/features/home/data/repositories/home_repository_impl.dart`
`HomeRepositoryImpl` implements `HomeRepository`.

#### [NEW] `lib/features/home/presentation/bloc/home_bloc.dart`
`HomeBloc` xử lý: `LoadUserProfile` → `HomeLoaded`, `HomeLoading`, `HomeError`.

#### [NEW] `lib/features/home/presentation/pages/home_page.dart`
Trang Home hiển thị profile card, greeting, logout button.

#### [NEW] `lib/features/home/presentation/widgets/profile_card.dart`
Widget hiển thị thông tin user (avatar, tên, email).

---

