## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests (Static Analysis)
```bash
cd /Users/vutruong/development/flutter_base/flutter_base_project
flutter pub get
dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs
flutter analyze
```

### Manual Verification - Chạy App
```bash
cd /Users/vutruong/development/flutter_base/flutter_base_project
flutter run
```
Kiểm tra:
1. App mở → màn hình Login hiển thị đúng UI (form email, password, nút Login)
2. Nhập email: `test@example.com`, password: `password123` → navigate sang Home
3. Trang Home hiển thị profile card, tên user, email
4. Nhấn Logout → quay về màn hình Login
